20","kind":"announcement","title":"ALMOST 10,000 WISHLIST - THANK YOU!","summary":"ALMOST 10,000 WISHLIST! Thank you everyone who has wishlisted 🔥🔥🔥 NOW LET'S CRASH THE SERVERS! Everyone gets 25 Gas Cans if we crash the servers during Next Fest 🤯 Daily Livestream with the Battle Bears creator starts at 3pm PT/6pm ET. Tell your friends BBG is back! Refer a friend and help the community earn more Gas Cans at global launch day November 4. Thanks to everyone who has been showing up to the Five Nights of BB Livestreams! It's amazing seeing the BB community come back together again.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:48:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035205","verified_at":"2026-10-23T07:34:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4408320-1846651706674102","game_id":"steam-4408320","kind":"announcement","title":"Final Discord Playtest this Thursday Oct 15","summary":"The next and final BATTLE BEARS GOLD playtest will take place on Thursday 15th October at 3pm PDT (6pm EDT, 11pm BST). Note that this is one hour earlier than previous weekday tests.This version will be available on Windows, iOS and Android, and gates will be open for 2 hours. To get involved please fill out the form in a previous announcement (if you haven’t done so already).Headline additions: -Custom keybinds -Jukebox -UI controller support -Lighting improvements -Lots of bug fixesA lot to te","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:07:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674102","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4408320-1846651706672808","game_id":"steam-4408320","kind":"announcement","title":"REFERRAL REWARDS: 650 SIGNS UPS as of Oct 13 🎉 Almost to 25 Gas Cans for All","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:50:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672808","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4408320-1844115010496751","game_id":"steam-4408320","kind":"announcement","title":"4rd Discord Playtest this Sunday Sep 20","summary":"The next BATTLE BEARS GOLD playtest will take place on Sunday 20th September at 1pm PDT (4pm EDT, 9pm BST). Gates will be open for at least 75 minutes. To get involved please fill out the form in previous announcement (if you haven't done so already). Join our Discord.gg/BattleBears to chat with the devs.See you on the Battlefield!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T07:19:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4408320-1841579228663666","game_id":"steam-4408320","kind":"announcement","title":"3rd Discord Playtest this Friday! A New Map comes to BBG!","summary":"The next BATTLE BEARS GOLD playtest will take place on Friday 21st August at 4pm PDT (7pm EDT, 12am BST). This version will still be Windows only, gates will be open for at least 75 minutes. To get involved please fill out the form in previous announcement (if you haven't done so already). This version contains:Auto matchmaking New Map: Sky World Bug fixesSee you on the Battlefield!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T20:24:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663666","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_re